<!-- FAQ SECTION -->
<section class="faq-section section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to know about getting started with SmartAuditX.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-container">
            <div class="faq-item active">
                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                    <span>What is SmartAuditX?</span>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>SmartAuditX is an enterprise-grade audit and compliance management platform that helps organizations manage companies, employees, branches, departments, audits, and compliance documentation in a single secure system.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                    <span>Is my data secure?</span>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Absolutely. SmartAuditX uses multi-tenant architecture with complete data isolation, ASP.NET Core Identity for authentication, role-based access control, and secure HTTPS-only cookies. Each company's data is fully segregated from others.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                    <span>Can I manage multiple companies?</span>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes. SmartAuditX is built on a multi-tenant architecture. Each company operates within its own isolated environment with separate employees, departments, branches, and audit records.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                    <span>What roles are supported?</span>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>SmartAuditX supports System Admin, Company Owner, Manager, and Auditor roles. Each role has carefully designed permissions appropriate to their responsibilities within the organization.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                    <span>How do I get started?</span>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Simply register your company, verify your email, and start setting up your organizational structure. You can add branches, departments, employees, and begin creating audits within minutes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

